<title>UK: Ottoman Finance sets 150 mln mark 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Ottoman Finance sets 150 mln mark 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers J.P. Morgan GmgH and UBS Germany.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OTTOMAN FINANCE CO. CAYMAN</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY    05.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.425   PAY DATE    05.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.8	 REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+388 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE/TU/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  TURKEY    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL NO 115</p>
<p> NOTES	SECURED BY AN ASSINGMENT OF RIGHTS UNDER A LOAN OF</p>
<p>		THE ISSUER TO OTTOMAN BANK ISTANBUL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
